            <div class="content-text">
                
                <p><strong>FM Radio Stations:</strong> Radio Mirchi, Radio City, Red FM in Pune. Section 37 rights over every transmission. Must comply with Section 31D statutory license for published music. Related: <a href="/copyright-registration">Copyright Registration</a> for original content.</p><p><strong>TV Production Houses and Channels:</strong> Marathi content for Zee Marathi, Star Pravah, Sony Marathi. Signal piracy protection. Content copyright for shows, scripts, music.</p><p><strong>OTT Platforms and Streaming:</strong> Whether internet streaming qualifies as 'broadcasting' under Section 2(dd) is evolving. Content copyright registration and licensing essential. Related: <a href="/private-limited-company-registration/pune">Pvt Ltd Registration in Pune</a> for media companies.</p><p><strong>Podcast Producers:</strong> Copyright in sound recordings and literary/musical works. Clear usage terms through licensing. Related: <a href="/trademark-registration">Trademark Registration</a> for podcast branding.</p><p><strong>Corporate AV and Ad Agencies:</strong> Broadcast-ready content (TV commercials, radio jingles). Clear copyright ownership and assignment deeds essential.</p>

