<!-- SECTION 7: 7-STEP PROCESS -->
<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">How to Protect Broadcast Copyright from Pune</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Content copyright filed on copyright.gov.in (Copyright Office New Delhi). Broadcast licensing regulated by MIB. TRAI regulates distribution. Infringement at Bombay HC Pune Bench. Patron handles all from Wagholi.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Audit Broadcast Assets and Content Ownership</h3><p class="step-description">Patron conducts a comprehensive audit of the Pune broadcasting organisation's assets: identifying all broadcast signals (radio frequencies, TV channels, OTT streams, podcast feeds), cataloguing underlying copyrightable content (music, scripts, films, literary works), mapping content ownership (owned vs licensed vs statutory license), and identifying gaps in copyright documentation.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Assets Catalogued</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Ownership Mapped</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="10" y="5" width="100" height="85" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="22" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Broadcast Audit</text><line x1="20" y1="30" x2="100" y2="30" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="0.8"/><rect x="20" y="36" width="80" height="8" rx="3" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="42" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Signals Catalogued</text><rect x="20" y="50" width="80" height="8" rx="3" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="56" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Content Ownership Mapped</text><rect x="20" y="64" width="80" height="8" rx="3" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="70" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Licensing Gaps Found</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Audit Complete</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 2</span><h3 class="step-title">Register Underlying Content Copyright</h3><p class="step-description">While broadcast reproduction right under Section 37 is automatic, the copyright in underlying content should be formally registered. Patron files Form XIV on copyright.gov.in for original content - scripts, music compositions, sound recordings, cinematographic films, and literary works. Related: <a href="/copyright-registration">Copyright Registration</a>.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Form XIV Filed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>IP Portfolio Built</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="28" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">copyright.gov.in</text><text x="60" y="44" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Form XIV Filed</text><rect x="30" y="52" width="60" height="12" rx="4" fill="#10B981" opacity="0.2"/><text x="60" y="61" font-size="6" fill="#10B981" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Content Registered</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Content Registered</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">Draft and Execute Licensing Agreements</h3><p class="step-description">For content acquired from third parties, Patron drafts content licensing agreements specifying broadcast rights (exclusive vs non-exclusive), territory, duration, royalty terms, and sub-licensing restrictions. For outbound licensing, Patron protects the broadcaster's reproduction right. Related: <a href="/brand-copyright-registration">Brand Copyright Registration</a>.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Inbound Drafted</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Outbound Protected</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="10" y="5" width="100" height="85" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="22" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Licensing</text><line x1="20" y1="30" x2="100" y2="30" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="25" y="44" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-family="Arial">Inbound (Acquire)</text><text x="25" y="56" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-family="Arial">Outbound (Distribute)</text><text x="25" y="68" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-family="Arial">Territory + Royalty</text><path d="M90 42l3 3 6-6" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M90 54l3 3 6-6" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M90 66l3 3 6-6" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Licensing Done</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 4</span><h3 class="step-title">Ensure Statutory License Compliance (Section 31D)</h3><p class="step-description">When a Pune radio station or broadcaster communicates published literary/musical works or sound recordings, Section 31D provides a statutory license - the broadcaster can use these works by paying prescribed royalties. Patron identifies which content requires royalty, calculates obligations, documents payments, and maintains compliance records.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Royalties Calculated</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Records Maintained</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="28" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Section 31D</text><text x="60" y="44" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Royalty Calculated</text><text x="60" y="56" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Payments Documented</text><rect x="30" y="64" width="60" height="10" rx="4" fill="#10B981" opacity="0.2"/><text x="60" y="72" font-size="6" fill="#10B981" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">Compliant</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">31D Compliant</span><span class="step-number-large">04</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 5</span><h3 class="step-title">Establish Anti-Piracy and Enforcement Framework</h3><p class="step-description">Patron helps establish enforcement: monitoring for unauthorised re-broadcasting (cable, IPTV, online), identifying signal piracy, preparing cease-and-desist notices, coordinating with legal counsel for Bombay High Court (Pune Bench) proceedings (injunctions, damages), and filing criminal complaints under Section 63 for serious infringement.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Monitoring Active</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Enforcement Ready</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="25" y="22" width="70" height="15" rx="4" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.15"/><text x="60" y="32" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">Anti-Piracy</text><text x="60" y="50" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Monitor + C&amp;D</text><text x="60" y="62" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Bombay HC Pune</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Protected</span><span class="step-number-large">05</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 6</span><h3 class="step-title">Integrate with Business Compliance</h3><p class="step-description">Broadcast revenue attracts GST (18% on advertising). Royalty payments have TDS implications. Content copyright is an intangible asset requiring amortisation. Patron integrates broadcast IP with business compliance - <a href="/gst-registration">GST</a>, <a href="/income-tax-return">ITR</a>, TDS, and accounting for royalty tracking.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>GST Configured</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Royalty Tracking Set</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="5" y="15" width="50" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="65" y="15" width="50" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><text x="30" y="32" font-size="6" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">GST</text><text x="90" y="32" font-size="6" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">TDS</text><text x="30" y="48" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Revenue</text><text x="90" y="48" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Royalties</text><path d="M24 56l4 4 8-8" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M84 56l4 4 8-8" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Fully Integrated</span><span class="step-number-large">06</span></div></div></div>

